---
// "Wer wir sind" — founder intro, placed before "Was uns besonders macht"
---

<section class="who-section" id="wer-wir-sind">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="who-grid">
      <div class="who-photo">
        <img
          src="/images/zara.webp"
          alt="Zara Martinetti, Gründerin von BricksnBytes"
          width="800"
          height="1045"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="photo-dot"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="who-text">
        <h2 class="section-heading">Wer wir sind</h2>
        <p>
          Hallo, ich bin Zara – Programmiertrainerin aus München und Gründerin von BricksnBytes.
          Seit Jahren begleite ich Kinder spielerisch in die Tech-Welt: Sie bauen Roboter mit LEGO SPIKE,
          programmieren in Minecraft und Scratch und machen erste Schritte mit Python. Bei uns wird gebaut
          und getüftelt – in kleinen Gruppen, ganz ohne Vorkenntnisse.
        </p>
        <a href="/uber-uns" class="who-link">Mehr über uns →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .who-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 70px 40px;
    background: #fff;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .who-grid {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .who-photo {
    position: relative;
  }

  .who-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    border-radius: 28px;
    transform: rotate(2deg);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
    display: block;
  }

  .photo-dot {
    position: absolute;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--coral);
    top: -8px;
    left: 18px;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .who-text p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .who-link {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--coral-deep);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .who-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Mobile: photo above text */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .who-section {
      padding: 48px 20px;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .who-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    /* 75 % of the former 300px */
    .who-photo {
      max-width: 225px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-heading {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .who-section {
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
